  "instructions": [
    "Steam the summer savoury leaves until tender.",
    "Mince the ginger and garlic, then saut\u00165 them in sesame oil until fragrant.",
    "Add the coconut cream, cashew milk, maple syrup, salt, black pepper, and turmeric to the pan, whisking until smooth.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
